{"created": "2022-03-18T21:13:50.333723+00:00", "modified": "2024-07-16T09:12:20.054864+00:00", "id": 6358607, "conceptrecid": "6358606", "doi": "10.5281/zenodo.6358607", "conceptdoi": "10.5281/zenodo.6358606", "doi_url": "https://doi.org/10.5281/zenodo.6358607", "metadata": {"title": "pallet-block-32965 \u2013 A chipwood re-identification dataset", "doi": "10.5281/zenodo.6358607", "publication_date": "2022-03-15", "description": "<p>The dataset &quot;<strong>pallet-block-32965</strong>&quot; contains images of 32965&nbsp;chipwood pallet blocks, of which 4 pictures each were taken from 2 different perspectives, with 2 different cameras, amounting to a total of 131860 images. This dataset is the successor of the dataset <a href=\"https://zenodo.org/record/6353714\">&quot;pallet- block-502&quot;</a>. This dataset is an integral part of our publication &quot;<a href=\"https://ieeexplore.ieee.org/abstract/document/10068869\">Deep Learning Based Re-Identification of Wooden Euro-pallets</a>&quot;, in which it was used for the purpose of re-identification. <strong>Therefore, if you use this dataset&nbsp;for research, please&nbsp;cite this publication.</strong></p>\n\n<p>This dataset is part of a collaboration between TU Dortmund University and Fraunhofer IML.&nbsp;Another related re-identification dataset is <a href=\"https://zenodo.org/record/7386956\">&quot;galvanized-636&quot;</a>. If you have any questions concerning this dataset, feel free to contact&nbsp;<a href=\"https://www.linkedin.com/in/jeromerutinowski/\">J&eacute;r&ocirc;me Rutinowski</a>.</p>\n\n<p>This work is part of the project &quot;Silicon Economy Logistics Ecosystem&quot; which is funded by the German Federal Ministry of Transport and Digital Infrastructure.</p>", "access_right": "open", "creators": [{"name": "Rutinowski, J\u00e9r\u00f4me", "affiliation": "TU Dortmund University", "orcid": "0000-0001-6907-9296"}, {"name": "Chilla, Tim", "affiliation": "Fraunhofer IML"}, {"name": "Pionzewski, Christian", "affiliation": "Fraunhofer IML"}], "keywords": ["re-identification", "deep learning", "EUR-pallets", "chipwood"], "resource_type": {"title": "Dataset", "type": "dataset"}, "license": {"id": "cc-by-4.0"}, "relations": {"version": [{"index": 0, "is_last": true, "parent": {"pid_type": "recid", "pid_value": "6358606"}}]}}, "title": "pallet-block-32965 \u2013 A chipwood re-identification dataset", "links": {"self": "https://zenodo.org/api/records/6358607", "self_html": "https://zenodo.org/records/6358607", "preview_html": "https://zenodo.org/records/6358607?preview=1", "doi": "https://doi.org/10.5281/zenodo.6358607", "self_doi": "https://doi.org/10.5281/zenodo.6358607", "self_doi_html": "https://zenodo.org/doi/10.5281/zenodo.6358607", "reserve_doi": "https://zenodo.org/api/records/6358607/draft/pids/doi", "parent": "https://zenodo.org/api/records/6358606", "parent_html": "https://zenodo.org/records/6358606", "parent_doi": "https://doi.org/10.5281/zenodo.6358606", "parent_doi_html": "https://zenodo.org/doi/10.5281/zenodo.6358606", "self_iiif_manifest": "https://zenodo.org/api/iiif/record:6358607/manifest", "self_iiif_sequence": "https://zenodo.org/api/iiif/record:6358607/sequence/default", "files": "https://zenodo.org/api/records/6358607/files", "media_files": "https://zenodo.org/api/records/6358607/media-files", "latest": "https://zenodo.org/api/records/6358607/versions/latest", "latest_html": "https://zenodo.org/records/6358607/latest", "versions": "https://zenodo.org/api/records/6358607/versions", "draft": "https://zenodo.org/api/records/6358607/draft", "access_links": "https://zenodo.org/api/records/6358607/access/links", "access_grants": "https://zenodo.org/api/records/6358607/access/grants", "access_users": "https://zenodo.org/api/records/6358607/access/users", "access_request": "https://zenodo.org/api/records/6358607/access/request", "access": "https://zenodo.org/api/records/6358607/access", "communities": "https://zenodo.org/api/records/6358607/communities", "com